message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "BeatGrid"
abstract: >-
  A mathematical Euclidean rhythm drum computer, polymetric phase-cycle
  analyzer, MIDI file compiler, and LilyPond percussion score studio. Computes,
  draws, and writes files, and is deliberately silent with no audio output.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/draarivpatel-ui/beatgrid"
url: "https://aariv.me/beatgrid/"
keywords:
